    "polygon": [
     [77, -38.2],
     [80, -38.2],
     [80, -23.8],
     [77, -23.8]
    ],
    "reason": "Vantage: the office bay is a lay-by 3 m deep, carriageway level, outer edge on the kerb. Plan x -168.2..-153.8, y -310..-307. The Oct 9 source has no bay object (the ground is one flat floor), so the lay-by is stated here. Checker C-4."
   },
   {
    "op": "addBay",
    "id": "squareBay",
    "polygon": [
     [4, -50],
     [13, -50],
     [13, -47],
     [4, -47]
    ],
    "reason": "Vantage: the square bay is a lay-by 3 m deep, carriageway level, outer edge on the kerb. Plan x -180..-177, y -243..-234. Not in the Oct 9 source. Checker C-4."
   },
   {
    "op": "addStructure",
    "item": {
     "id": "office-boarding-pavilion",
     "name": "Official door canopy",
     "category": "boarding-canopy",
     "polygon": [
      [75.5, -33],
      [78.5, -33],
      [78.5, -27],
      [75.5, -27]
     ],
     "z": 4.05,
     "height": 0.57
    },
    "reason": "Vantage, brief 008 B2 (L2; Sky's walk note 'parking bay goes into building'): the 15 x 3.827 pavilion at x 73.173..77 stood 2.327 x 6 m inside tower-official (x 69.5..75.5, y -33..-27). It is now a canopy carried on the tower's south face: back edge on the face (x 75.5, overlap 0), the tower's width (y -33..-27), 3 m out over the 1.5 m pavement and the kerb half of the lay-by (x 77..78.5). No posts: the pavement at the tower is 1.5 m and stays clear. z 4.05 is the soffit above the pavement (4.23 above the lay-by), top 4.62 as before; nothing of it stands on the ground. Why not the pavilion moved over the bay: a 15 m roof to x 80 hides the door from the play camera (yaw 30, pitch 38: at the door everything above 0.9 m), and its piers have no ground but the wide pavement or the lay-by. At 3 m a person at the door point (76.25, -30) is seen whole (hidden only above 2.0 m) and Vale is under cover from the door to the car door; 'Official drop-off' (78.2) and 'Boarding pavilion' (78.3) stay under it."
   },
   {
    "op": "addStructure",
    "item": {
     "id": "square-boarding-pavilion",
     "name": "Square bay canopy",
     "category": "boarding-canopy",
     "polygon": [
      [4.3, -47],
      [12.7, -47],
      [12.7, -44.858],
      [4.3, -44.858]
     ],
     "z": 0,
     "height": 2.587
    },
    "reason": "Vantage: as the office bay canopy; footprint 8.4 x 2.143 and height 2.587 from the Oct 5 testbed manifest, on the pavement edge at y -47."
   },
   {
    "op": "edit",
    "id": "office-pavilion-support-0",
    "move": [-2.3, 0],
    "z": 0,
    "height": 3.633,
    "reason": "Out of the lay-by onto the pavement (x 77.3..79.3 -> 75..77), z -0.18 -> 0, height cut by the 0.18. Brief 008 B2: the canopy is now carried on the tower and this pier carries nothing; it is removed by the pending `remove` below. Until that op exists it stays here, clear of the tower (y -37.75..-35.75) and of the bay."
   },
   {
    "op": "edit",
    "id": "office-pavilion-support-1",
    "move": [-2.3, 0],
    "z": 0,
    "height": 3.633,
    "reason": "As office-pavilion-support-0 (y -26.25..-24.25). Until it is removed it still overlaps the civic-office-north bed by about 0.7 x 1.6 m, as it did before."
   },
   {
    "op": "edit",
    "id": "square-pavilion-support-0",
    "move": [0, 1.16],
    "z": 0,
    "height": 1.955,
    "reason": "Supports follow the canopy out of the lay-by (y -48.16..-47.04 -> -47..-45.88, inside the canopy footprint); z -0.18 was the lay-by level, now they stand on the pavement, height cut by the 0.18 so the top stays where the source had it."
   },
   {
    "op": "edit",
    "id": "square-pavilion-support-1",
    "move": [0, 1.16],
    "z": 0,
    "height": 1.955,
    "reason": "As square-pavilion-support-0."
   },
   {
    "op": "addStructure",
    "item": {
     "id": "office-public-landing",
     "name": "Public door landing",
     "category": "entrance-landing",
     "polygon": [
      [51, -32.3],
      [52.5, -32.3],
      [52.5, -27.7],
      [51, -27.7]
     ],
     "z": 0,
     "height": 0.75
    },
    "reason": "Vantage, brief 008 B2 (L1, H4): steps are real geometry. The public door is on tower-public's north face (x 52.5), on the tower's axis y -30, which is also the axis of the Orbit Walk crossing (y -32.5..-27.5) and of the fountain. Landing 1.5 m deep (x 51..52.5), 4.6 m wide, top at 0.75: 'Office entrance' stands on it at (51.75, -30), 0.75 m off the face. Sizes are Vela's RecordsEntrance (pivot 52.5, -30; front north)."
   },
   {
    "op": "addStructure",
    "item": {
     "id": "office-public-steps",
     "name": "Public door steps",
     "category": "entrance-steps",
     "polygon": [
      [49.2, -32.3],
      [51, -32.3],
      [51, -27.7],
      [49.2, -27.7]
     ],
     "z": 0,
     "height": 0.625,
     "risers": 6,
     "rise": 0.125,
     "going": 0.36,
     "foot": [49.2, -30],
     "top": [51, -30],
     "landing": "office-public-landing"
    },
    "reason": "Vantage, brief 008 B2 (L1, H4): the flight to the landing. 6 risers of 0.125 m (0.75 m), 5 treads of 0.36 m (1.8 m), foot at x 49.2, 3.3 m out from the face; height 0.625 is the top tread. 'Office approach' stands at the foot, (48.6, -30), 0.6 m before the first riser. How the sim takes the height is Keel's (H4)."
   },
   {
    "op": "edit",
    "id": "civic-entrance-west",
    "move": [0, 0.5],
    "reason": "Brief 008 B2: the two entrance beds sat about y -30.4, the door is on the tower axis y -30. RecordsEntrance's pier plinth reaches y -26.02 (x 51.47..52.73) and this bed reached y -26.302: 0.28 m overlap. Moved 0.5 m east: the bed starts at y -25.802, 0.22 m off the plinth, 1.2 m off the tower flank (y -27). Chosen over centring the door on y -30.4 (the arch would sit 0.4 m off the tower's axis: 0.4 and 1.2 m of face beside it, one pier in the tower's corner) and over narrowing the piers (a piece change for 0.02 m of clearance)."
   },
   {
    "op": "edit",
    "id": "civic-entrance-east",
    "move": [0, 0.4],
    "reason": "As civic-entrance-west, so the pair is centred on the door: this bed's edge at the pier line (x 51.47) goes from y -34.578 to -34.178, 0.20 m off the plinth (y -33.98). Corridor between the beds 8.30 m, centre y -29.95."
   },
   {
    "op": "edit",
    "id": "civic-office-north",
    "move": [0, 1.4],
    "reason": "Brief 008 B2: this bed reached y -27.219 at x 74.1..75.0, 0.22 m inside tower-official (y -33..-27, x to 75.5), and its east side lay under the official door's east pier (plinth y -26.98..-26.02, x 75.27..76.53). Moved 1.4 m east along the wing face: it starts at y -25.819, 0.2 m off the pier and 1.18 m off the tower; still 1.34 m off the wing face (x 72.5) and 1.26 m off the lay-by (x 77)."
   }
  ]
